docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/logs/T03.log:5091:docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/logs/T04.log:51830:+This directory stores the Phase 0 baseline required by `## Phase 0: Fork Foundation` in [docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-plan.md](/home/pete/cadres/lattice/docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-plan.md:566). The purpose is to measure the current Lattice workflow hot paths before the fork-build phases change identity resolution, event capture, retrieval, or metrics behavior.
